{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":27.729999542236328,"text":"A stone shaped like half an egg, covered with a carved net of woolen bands. It marked the spot considered the center of the world. It is not a natural rock, it is a carved object made to be pointed at. What you see in the museum is a Roman copy of an older one. The idea that a people has appointed treats as the center of the earth turns up in many cultures, and the point is almost always inside their own borders.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.6399999856948853},{"word":"stone","start":0.6399999856948853,"end":0.9399999976158142},{"word":"shaped","start":0.9399999976158142,"end":1.4199999570846558},{"word":"like","start":1.4199999570846558,"end":1.7400000095367432},{"word":"half","start":1.7400000095367432,"end":1.9800000190734863},{"word":"an","start":1.9800000190734863,"end":2.2799999713897705},{"word":"egg","start":2.2799999713897705,"end":2.4000000953674316},{"word":"covered","start":3.0799999237060547,"end":3.0799999237060547},{"word":"with","start":3.0799999237060547,"end":3.319999933242798},{"word":"a","start":3.319999933242798,"end":3.859999895095825},{"word":"carved","start":3.859999895095825,"end":3.859999895095825},{"word":"net","start":3.859999895095825,"end":4.239999771118164},{"word":"of","start":4.239999771118164,"end":4.599999904632568},{"word":"woolen","start":4.599999904632568,"end":4.840000152587891},{"word":"bands","start":4.840000152587891,"end":5.239999771118164},{"word":"It","start":5.820000171661377,"end":6.039999961853027},{"word":"marked","start":6.039999961853027,"end":6.21999979019165},{"word":"the","start":6.21999979019165,"end":6.539999961853027},{"word":"spot","start":6.539999961853027,"end":6.800000190734863},{"word":"considered","start":6.800000190734863,"end":7.260000228881836},{"word":"the","start":7.260000228881836,"end":7.599999904632568},{"word":"center","start":7.599999904632568,"end":7.840000152587891},{"word":"of","start":7.840000152587891